# Supabase connection details for Do You Know Them.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the two values from the new
# Supabase project (Settings -> API). `.env.local` is listed in .gitignore, so
# it never gets uploaded to GitHub.
#
# The same two values must ALSO be entered by hand in Vercel
# (Settings -> Environment Variables), or the app works locally and breaks live.
#
# The key below is the PUBLISHABLE key. Supabase used to call this the "anon"
# key. It is designed to be visible in the browser and is safe to share.
# The "secret" key is the dangerous one - it is not here, and must never be.
#
# THESE MUST BE THIS PROJECT'S OWN VALUES. Pointing them at any other
# project's database would let this app read and write into it.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
